    <node id="RELATIONSHIP ID 2526: SOURCE: NCCN CANCER CENTERS → TARGET: NCCN — &quot;NCCN IS THE NETWORK ASSOCIATED WITH NCCN CANCER CENTERS.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">RELATIONSHIP ID 2526: SOURCE: NCCN CANCER CENTERS → TARGET: NCCN — "NCCN IS THE NETWORK ASSOCIATED WITH NCCN CANCER CENTERS."</data>
      <data key="d1">RELATIONSHIP ID 2526: SOURCE: NCCN CANCER CENTERS → TARGET: NCCN — "NCCN IS THE NETWORK ASSOCIATED WITH NCCN CANCER CENTERS."</data>
