      <data key="d6"> Source: CLINICAL TRIAL → Target: NCCN CANCER CENTERS — "The NCCN Cancer Centers serve as a key resource for locating clinical trials, specifically within the United States. These centers assist patients in identifying and accessing clinical trial opportunities, making them a valuable source of information for those seeking participation in research studies. The entity CLINICAL TRIAL is central to this resource, as the primary function of the NCCN Cancer Centers is to connect individuals with relevant clinical trials. In summary, NCCN Cancer Centers provide a United States–based resource dedicated to helping patients find clinical trials."</data>
    </node>
