      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">Mohs surgeons are doctors, usually dermatologists, with advanced training in Mohs surgery and reconstruction after surgery. They remove the tumor, ensure no more cancer can be seen using a microscope, and can restore the appearance of the affected area with reconstructive surgery.
Relationships:
