      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Family members may have undergone genetic testing, and this information is an important part of their health history. The patient should be aware of whether any relatives have had genetic testing, as it can provide valuable context for understanding inherited risks and guiding medical decisions.</data>
