      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">The patient and the doctor are engaged in an ongoing medical consultation. During their visits, the patient actively asks questions and discusses test results with the doctor. The patient also seeks guidance on birth control options and consults the doctor about the best time to plan a pregnancy. Through these interactions, the patient works with the doctor to address reproductive health concerns and make informed decisions.</data>
